== the four shop levels' card answers (experiments/benchmark/shop/tasks.json), built by plan_pay.py levels
   shop-serve (MiniGrid-Shop-v0): Whenever a client comes in, take their order, fetch food from the pantry, prepare it at the stove and give it to them; if the food falls, pick it up on your very next move.
     hard Response(client_arrived, order_taken): (G (client_arrived -> (F order_taken)))
     hard Response(order_taken, food_prepared): (G (order_taken -> (F food_prepared)))
     hard Response(food_prepared, order_served): (G (food_prepared -> (F order_served)))
     hard ChainResponse(food_fell, holding_food): (G (food_fell -> (X holding_food)))
   shop-full (MiniGrid-Shop-v0): Run the shop: whenever the siren rings, turn it off, and whenever a client comes in, take their order, fetch food from the pantry, prepare it at the stove and give it to them; if the food falls, pick it up on your very next move.
     hard Response(siren_ringing, switch_toggled): (G (siren_ringing -> (F switch_toggled)))
     hard Response(client_arrived, order_taken): (G (client_arrived -> (F order_taken)))
     hard Response(order_taken, food_prepared): (G (order_taken -> (F food_prepared)))
     hard Response(food_prepared, order_served): (G (food_prepared -> (F order_served)))
     hard ChainResponse(food_fell, holding_food): (G (food_fell -> (X holding_food)))
   shop-quiet-first (MiniGrid-Shop-v0): Run the shop: whenever the siren rings, turn it off, and whenever a client comes in, take their order, fetch food from the pantry, prepare it at the stove and give it to them; if the food falls, pick it up on your very next move. Never give a client their food while the siren is ringing.
     hard Response(siren_ringing, switch_toggled): (G (siren_ringing -> (F switch_toggled)))
     hard Response(client_arrived, order_taken): (G (client_arrived -> (F order_taken)))
     hard Response(order_taken, food_prepared): (G (order_taken -> (F food_prepared)))
     hard Response(food_prepared, order_served): (G (food_prepared -> (F order_served)))
     hard ChainResponse(food_fell, holding_food): (G (food_fell -> (X holding_food)))
     hard Absence(served_while_ringing): (~(F served_while_ringing))
   shop-boil (MiniGrid-Shop-Pot-v0): Run the shop: whenever the siren rings, turn it off, and whenever a client comes in, take their order, fetch food from the pantry, prepare it at the stove and give it to them; if the food falls, pick it up on your very next move. Whenever the pot boils over, put down what you hold next to the stove, turn the stove down, and pick your item up again.
     hard Response(siren_ringing, switch_toggled): (G (siren_ringing -> (F switch_toggled)))
     hard Response(client_arrived, order_taken): (G (client_arrived -> (F order_taken)))
     hard Response(order_taken, food_prepared): (G (order_taken -> (F food_prepared)))
     hard Response(food_prepared, order_served): (G (food_prepared -> (F order_served)))
     hard ChainResponse(food_fell, holding_food): (G (food_fell -> (X holding_food)))
     hard Response(pot_boiling, stove_fixed): (G (pot_boiling -> (F stove_fixed)))
